  <para style="h">Tesalonika 1</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tesalonika bi l</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tesalonika 1</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tes1</para>
  <para style="mt1">Tesalonika bi 1</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 1:1" />Paulo kɛ Sila kɛ Timoteo nɛ ngma womi nɛ ɔ kɛ ya ha Tesalonika asafo nɛ ji Tsɛ Mawu kɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo ni ɔmɛ ɔ. Dloomi kɛ he jɔmi nɛ ji nike ni nɛ je wa Tsɛ Mawu kɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dɛ mi ɔ ha nyɛ.<verse eid="1TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 1:2" />Wa naa Mawu si daa ngɛ nyɛ he, nɛ wa sɔleɔ kɛ haa nyɛ be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="1TH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 1:3" />Wa kai nyɛ suɔmi ni peemi ni kpakpa amɛ ngɛ wa sɔlemi mi, kɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ nyɛ kɛ ngɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu blɔ hyɛe ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">A hemi kɛ yemi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 1:4" />Nyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ ngɛ Mawu mi, wa le kaa Mawu nɛ hla nyɛ, <verse eid="1TH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 1:5" />ejakaa Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ wa kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ ɔ, e pi ni sɛɛmi gu kɛkɛ ha nyɛ, se mohu nyɛ bu tue kɛ bua jɔmi babauu. Nɛ e wo yiblii ngɛ nyɛ mi, ejakaa Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ ma nɔ mi kaa nɔ́ nɛ wa de nyɛ ɔ, e ji anɔkuale munyu. Nɛ nyɛ le bɔ nɛ wa je mi bami hu ye wa munyu ɔ he odase kɛ ha nyɛ ha. <verse eid="1TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 1:6" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛ plɛ waa kɛ Nutsɔ ɔ kaseli, ejakaa nyɛ he munyu ɔ atuu kɛ Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ mi bua jɔmi nɛ nyɛ na a, tse be ɔ, nyɛ ná kahi kɛ aywilɛho yemi tete kɛ je mi.<verse eid="1TH 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 1:7" />Nɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ plɛ nɔ hyɛmi nɔ kɛ ha Kristo se nyɛɛli tsuo nɛ ngɛ Makedonia kɛ Akaia a. <verse eid="1TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 1:8" />Amlɔ nɛ ɔ, e ha nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ munyu ɔ je nyɛ ngɔ nɛ e gbɛ fia, pi ngɛ Makedonia kɛ Akaia kɛkɛ, se mohu e jije kɛ ho lokoo ya, ejakaa he fɛɛ he nɛ wa ya a, a de wɔ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ nyɛ na ngɛ Mawu mi ɔ, nɛ e hia we wɔ fiɛmi ko hu, <verse eid="1TH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 1:9" />ejakaa mɛ nitsɛmɛ a de wɔ bɔ nɛ nyɛ pee wɔ nubwɔ ha, kɛ bɔ nɛ nyɛ kpale ngɛ nyɛ wɔ ɔmɛ a se kɛ ba Mawu ngɔ, nɛ jehanɛ ɔ anɔkuale Mawu hɛ kalɔ ɔ pɛ ji nyɛ Nutsɔ. <verse eid="1TH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 1:10" />Nɛ nyɛ ngɛ Mawu Bi nɛ ji Yesu nɛ e tle lɛ si kɛ je gbeje ɔ e bami ekohu ɔ blɔ hyɛe kɛ je hiɔwe. Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ ma je wɔ kɛ je Mawu mi mi nɛ fu wɔ ngɛ wa yayami ɔmɛ a he ɔ mi.<verse eid="1TH 1:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TH 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 2:1" />Mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ le se nami nɛ ngɛ wa slaami ɔ he. <verse eid="1TH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 2:2" />Nyɛ le bɔ nɛ a wa wɔ yi mi, kɛ bɔ nɛ wa na nɔ ngɛ Filipi loko ji wa kɛ ba nyɛ ngɔ ɔ. Se kɛ ɔ, Mawu wo wɔ kã nɛ wa kɛ Manye Munyu ɔ ba nyɛ ngɔ, tse be ɔ, he nyɛli bɔle wɔ kɛ kpe. <verse eid="1TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 2:3" />Nɛ nyɛ na hu kaa tsa pi lakpa fiɛmi nɛ wa ngɛ fiɛe aloo yi mi tomi yaya ko nɛ wa hɛɛ, se mohu e ji anɔkuale fiɛmi nɛ mu ko be he.<verse eid="1TH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mawu tsɔli ɔmɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 2:4" />Ejakaa wa tu munyu kaa Mawu tsɔli nɛ a to anɔkuale ɔ fiɛmi kɛ wo wa dɛ; nɛ wa tsakee we munyu ɔ hɛ mi bɔ nɛ maa sa e nuli ɔmɛ, ejakaa Mawu, nɔ nɛ le wa tsui mi ni susumi ɔmɛ ɔ nɛ wa ngɛ sɔmɔe. <verse eid="1TH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 2:5" />Nɛ kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ le ɔ, waa kɛ nya mi dɔkɔdɔkɔ munyu ko ba sisi we nyɛ, nɛ Mawu ji wa odase kaa wa yi nyɛ lakpa, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ waa kɛ nyɛ nɛ pee huɛ nɛ nyɛɛ ke wɔ sika. <verse eid="1TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 2:6" />Akɛnɛ Kristo bɔfohi ji wɔ he je ɔ, wa ngɛ he blɔ nɛ waa kɛ wa hɛ fɔɔ nyɛ nɔ, se wa hla we yi jemi ko kɛ ji nyɛ loo nɔ kpa ko dɛ. <verse eid="1TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 2:7" />Se mohu wa hi nyɛ kpɛti kɛ mi mi jɔmi kaa bɔ nɛ binyɛ hɛɛ e bimɛ nɛ e lɛɛ mɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 2:8" />Akɛnɛ wa suɔ nyɛ saminya he je ɔ, tsa pi Mawu Manye Munyu ɔ kɛkɛ nɛ wa kɛ ba ha nyɛ, se mohu wa kɛ wa wami tete piɛ he.<verse eid="1TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 2:9" />Mamimɛ, anɛ nyɛ kai we wa pɔ tɔtɔɛ kɛ dengme gbomi ɔ be nɛ wa ngɛ Manye Munyu ɔ fiɛe ngɛ nyɛ kpɛti ɔ? Kaa wa tsu ni nyɔ kɛ pia bɔ nɛ pee nɛ waa kɛ wa hɛ nɛ ko fɔ nyɛ ti nɔ ko nɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 2:10" />Nyɛ nitsɛmɛ kɛ Mawu ji wa he odase yeli kaa wa ye nyɛ anɔkuale nɛ waa kɛ nyɛ hi si ngɛ klɔuklɔu peemi mi nɛ piami ko be wa he. <verse eid="1TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 2:11" />Nyɛ kai we bɔ nɛ waa kɛ nyɛ tuɔ munyu ha kaa tsɛ kɛ e bimɛ, nɛ wa kpaa pɛɛ kɛ haa nyɛ, nɛ wa woɔ nyɛ he wami, <verse eid="1TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 2:12" />bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ je mi bami nɛ sa Mawu hɛ mi, nɔ́ nɛ tsɛ nyɛ kɛ ba e matsɛ yemi kɛ e hɛ mi nyami ɔ mi ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 2:13" />Nɛ wa maa na Mawu si daa ngɛ enɛ ɔ he, kaa benɛ wa fiɛ kɛ tsɔɔ nyɛ ɔ, nyɛ he we fiɛmi ɔ kaa wɔ nitsɛmɛ wa yi mi tomi munyu, se mohu nyɛ he ye kaa e ji Mawu Munyu niinɛ, nɛ e tsake nyɛ je mi bami benɛ nyɛ he ye ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 2:14" />Jehanɛ ɔ, mamimɛ, kaa bɔ nɛ Yuda bi ɔmɛ wa Yudea asafo ɔmɛ yi mi ɔ, ja a nɔuu a wa nyɛ hu yi mi ngɛ nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ ma a mi. <verse eid="1TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 2:15" />Nɛ benɛ a gbe mɛ nitsɛmɛ a gbali ɔmɛ se ɔ, a gbe Nutsɔ Yesu hulɔ. Jehanɛ ɔ, a wa wɔ yi mi saminya nɛ a fie wɔ. A te si kɛ wo Mawu kɛ nɔmlɔ adesa tsuo, <verse eid="1TH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 2:16" />nɛ a ngɛ wɔ blɔ tsie bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wa ko ya fiɛ kɛ tsɔɔ ma je li ɔmɛ nɛ a he a yi wami. Enɛ ɔ ha nɛ a ngɛ nɔ yae kɛ yayami peemi. Se nyagbe mi ɔ, Mawu mi mi fumi ba a nɔ.<verse eid="1TH 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 2:17" />Mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, benɛ wa mi gba nɛ wa si nyɛ be kpiti ko, se wa tsui ji nyɛ he ɔ, wa bɔ mɔde kaa wa ma ba na nyɛ hɛ mi ekohu. <verse eid="1TH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 2:18" />Wa suɔ kaa waa ba nyɛ ngɔ, nɛ imi Paulo i ka si abɔ nɛ ma ba nyɛ ngɔ, se Abosiami tsi wɔ blɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 2:19" />Ejakaa mɛni ji wa ni tsumi, nɔ́ nɛ haa wɔ hɛ nɔ kami kɛ bua jɔmi nɛ peeɔ wa hiɔwo kɛ wa jlasi. Nyɛ i. Nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ma ha wa ma na bua jɔmi babauu be nɛ wɔ tsuo wa ma pue ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo hɛ mi, be mi nɛ e maa ba ekohu ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 2:20" />Ejakaa nyɛ ji wa hɛ mi nyami kɛ wa bua jɔmi.<verse eid="1TH 2:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Timoteo bua jɔmi munyu ɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 3:1" />Nyagbe mi ɔ, benɛ i nyɛ we hu ɔ, i pee ye juɛmi kaa ma tlɔ Ateene kɛkɛ, ami nɔ kake, <verse eid="1TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 3:2" />nɛ ma tsɔ Timoteo, wa nyɛmi kɛ nɔ nɛ waa kɛ lɛ tsuɔ ni, nɛ e ji Mawu sɔmɔlɔ ɔ, nɛ e ba slaa nyɛ, nɛ e ha nyɛ na kã, <verse eid="1TH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 3:3" />bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ ko gbɔjɔ ngɛ haomihi nɛ ngɛ nyɛ nɔ bae ɔ a mi. Se nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ le momo kaa kikɛmɛ a haomi nɛ ɔmɛ piɛ Mawu blɔ nya nɛ e to kɛ ha wɔ Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔ he. <verse eid="1TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 3:4" />Benɛ waa kɛ nyɛ ngɛ po ɔ, wa de nyɛ kɛ to kaa e be kɛe nɛ haomi maa ba nyɛ nɔ, nɛ e ba mi.<verse eid="1TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 3:5" />Kaa bɔ nɛ i de momo ɔ, benɛ i nyɛ we tsui nɛ ma to hu ɔ, i tsɔ Timoteo konɛ e ba hyɛ ha kaa nyɛ hɛɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi kpɛii kɛ sa lo, aloo Abosiami ba ye nyɛ nɔ kunimi nɛ wa dengme gbomi ɔ tsuo pee yaka? <verse eid="1TH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 3:6" />Se amlɔ nɛ ɔ, Timoteo kpale kɛ ba wa ngɔ kɛ manye, nɛ e ba bɔ wɔ kaa nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi kɛ nyɛ suɔmi ɔ mi wa ja a nɔuu, nɛ nyɛ kai be nɛ wa ba slaa nyɛ ɔ kɛ bua jɔmi, nɛ nyɛ hɛ ngɛ jae ngɛ wa he kaa bɔ nɛ wɔ hu wa hɛ ngɛ jae ngɛ nyɛ he ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 3:7" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, mamimɛ, akɛnɛ wa na le hemi kɛ yemi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi ɔ, wa bua jɔ wa he ngɛ wa nɔ́ nami kɛ wa haomi ɔmɛ tsuo mi. <verse eid="1TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 3:8" />Nɛ wa ma nyɛ da nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ́ nya, akɛnɛ wa na le kaa nyɛ daa si kpɛii ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 3:9" />Kɛ wa maa pee kɛ na Mawu si babauu kɛ ha nyɛ kɛɛ, ngɛ bua jɔmi kɛ suɔmi nɛ nyɛ je kpo kɛ tsɔɔ wɔ ngɛ sɔlemi nɛ wa sɔleɔ kɛ haa nyɛ ɔ he? <verse eid="1TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 3:10" />Ejakaa nyɔ kɛ pia tsuo ɔ, wa kpaa pɛɛ nɛ wa biɔ Mawu nɛ e ha waa na nyɛ hɛ mi ekohu, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ waa ye kɛ bua nyɛ nɛ nyɛ hemi kɛ yemi ɔ nɛ hyi tɔ. <verse eid="1TH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 3:11" />Wa Tsɛ Mawu ɔ nitsɛ kɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu nɛ ha nɛ waa ba nyɛ ngɔ ekohu. <verse eid="1TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 3:12" />Nutsɔ ɔ nɛ ha nɛ nyɛ hyi tɔ kɛ suɔmi kɛ be nɔ, nɛ nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he kɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ kaa bɔ nɛ wɔ hu wa suɔ nyɛ ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 3:13" />Kɛ gu enɛ ɔ nɔ ɔ, wa Tsɛ Mawu ɔ ma ha nyɛ tsui mi ma tsɔ kɛ pi si, nɛ yayami ko be nyɛ he hie. Nyɛ maa da si ngɛ e hɛ mi nɛ nyɛ maa ye bemi ngɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo kɛ e ni klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ a bami ligbi ɔ nɔ.<verse eid="1TH 3:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Nyɛ hla dami se blɔ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1-2" style="v" sid="1TH 4:1-2" />Jehanɛ ɔ, mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, nyɛ le momo bɔ nɛ e sa kaa nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi ha, ejakaa nyɛ le wa Nutsɔ Yesu nitsɛ mlaa amɛ nɛ wa wo nyɛ ɔ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, wa ngɛ nyɛ pɛɛ kpae ngɛ Nutsɔ Yesu biɛ mi kaa nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi ja a pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:1-2" /><verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="1TH 4:3-4" />Ejakaa Mawu suɔmi nya ni ji kaa nyɛɛ hi klɔuklɔu, nɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ nyɛ he ngɛ ajuama bɔmi he, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ ngɔ yo ngɛ klɔuklɔu peemi kɛ hɛ mi nyami mi, <verse eid="1TH 4:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 4:5" />nɛ nyɛ ko di he lo akɔnɔ se kaa bɔ nɛ wɔ jali nɛ li Mawu peeɔ ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 4:6" />Nɛ nɔ ko nɛ kó sisi e nyɛmi nɛ e kpɔ e yo, ejakaa Nutsɔ ɔ maa gbla e tue ngɛ enɛ ɔ he, kaa bɔ nɛ wa de nyɛ momo ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 4:7" />Ejakaa Mawu tsɛ we wɔ nɛ wa juɛmi mi nɛ sɛ mu kɛ akɔnɔ níhi, se mohu nɛ wa he nɛ tsɔ nɛ waa pee klɔuklɔu. <verse eid="1TH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 4:8" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, ke nɔ ko yi mlaa nɛ ɔmɛ a nɔ ɔ, pi nimli a mlaahi a nɔ tue nɛ e ngɛ gboe, se mohu Mawu nɔ nɛ ha nyɛ e Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 4:9" />Nɛ e he hia we kaa ma de nyɛ nɔ́ ko tsɔ ngɛ nyɛmimɛ a suɔmi klɔuu, nɛ sa nɛ a na ngɛ Mawu we bimɛ a kpɛti ɔ he. Ejakaa Mawu nitsɛ ngɛ nyɛ tsɔɔe bɔ nɛ sa nɛ nyɛɛ suɔ nyɛ he ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 4:10" />Ngɛ anɔkuale mi ɔ, suɔmi nɛ nyɛ ngɛ kɛ ha Kristo se nyɛɛli ngɛ nyɛ ma a tsuo mi ɔ mi kuɔ. Se kɛ ɔ, anyɛmimɛ, wa ngɛ nyɛ pɛɛ kpae nɛ nyɛɛ suɔ mɛ pe kekle ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 4:11" />Nɛ enɛ ɔ nɛ pee nyɛ oti, kaa nyɛɛ ba nyɛ je mi ngɛ kpoo peemi mi, nɛ nyɛɛ kɛ nyɛ he nɛ ko wo ni kpahi a sane mi. Nyɛ tsu nyɛ nitsɛmɛ nyɛ ni tsumi kaa bɔ nɛ wa de nyɛ momo ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 4:12" />Ke nyɛ pee ja a, nyɛ hɛ mi maa ba nyami ngɛ nihi nɛ pi Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔ a hɛ mi, nɛ a maa bu nyɛ; nɛ nyɛ be nyɛ hɛ woe kɛ fɔ ni kpahi a nɔ ngɛ nyɛ hiami níhi a he.<verse eid="1TH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ gbenɔ kɛ e si temi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 4:13" />Jehanɛ ɔ, mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, ma suɔ kaa nyɛɛ le nɔ́ nɛ baa Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ nɛ gbo ɔ e nɔ, konɛ nyɛ ko ye kɔmɔ tsɔ, kaa nihi nɛ be he nɔ kami ke e ba mi ja a. <verse eid="1TH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 4:14" />Ejakaa akɛnɛ wa heɔ yeɔ kaa Yesu gbo nɛ e te si kɛ je gbeje ɔ, ja a nɔuu e sa kaa wa he ye , kaa be mi nɛ Yesu maa kpale kɛ ba a, Mawu ma tle Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ gbo ɔmɛ si ngɔ piɛ e he kɛ ba.<verse eid="1TH 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 4:15" />I ngɛ nyɛ enɛ ɔ dee kaa munyu nɛ je Nutsɔ ɔ nya, kaa wɔ ni nɛmɛ nɛ wa ma ji hɛ kali be mi nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ maa ba a, wa be ni nɛmɛ nɛ gbo ɔmɛ a hlami sɛe kɛ ya kpee lɛ. <verse eid="1TH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 4:16" />Ejakaa Nutsɔ ɔ nitsɛ ma kple si kɛ je hiɔwe kɛ ngmlaa nɛ nya wa, kɛ hiɔwe bɔfo nɔkɔtɔma a gbi kɛ ha klaahi a he wami womi, kɛ Mawu titimati pɛmi nɛ nya wa. Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ gbo ɔmɛ kekle maa te si kɛ ya kpee Nutsɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 4:17" />Nɛ lɔ ɔ se loko wɔ hɛ kali ɔmɛ nɛ piɛ ngɛ zugba a nɔ ɔ, waa kɛ mɛ kulaa ma futu ngɛ bɔ kuu ɔmɛ a mi kɛ ya kpee lɛ, nɛ waa kɛ lɛ maa hi si kɛ ya neneene. <verse eid="1TH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 4:18" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ kɛ kikɛmɛ a munyu nɛ ɔ nɛ ha nyɛ bi bua jɔmi kɛ he wami.<verse eid="1TH 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TH 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TH 5:1" />Mɛni be kulaa nɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ maa ba mi?</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TH 5:1">Mamimɛ, e hia we nɛ ma de nyɛ nɔ́ ko ngɛ enɛ ɔ he, <verse eid="1TH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TH 5:2" />nyɛ le kaa nɔ ko li. Ejakaa Nutsɔ ɔ ligbi ɔ maa ba tlukaa kaa julɔ baa nyɔ mi ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TH 5:3" />Jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, nihi maa hi dee ke, “Nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ ngɛ nɔ yae pɛpɛɛpɛ, tue mi jɔmi kɛ he jɔmi ngɛ.” Kɛkɛ ɔ, si kake too ɔ, hɛ mi kpatami maa ba a nɔ tlukaa kaa bɔ nɛ kɔɔmi tuaa yohɔlɔ loko e fɔɔ ɔ. Nɛ a be mi jee gbleegbleegblee, ejakaa he ko be nɛ a ma ya laa ngɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TH 5:4" />Se mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, a wui nyɛ diblii mi ngɛ nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ a mi, nɛ nyɛ nya be nyɛ he kpɛe ke Nutsɔ ɔ bami ligbi ɔ ba ti nyɛ si tlukaa kaa julɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TH 5:5" />Ejakaa la kɛ piani bimɛ ji nyɛ tsuo, nɛ nyɛ pi diblii kɛ nyɔ bimɛ. <verse eid="1TH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TH 5:6" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ pee klaalo. Nyɛ ko hwɔ mahe kaa ni kpa amɛ, nɛ nyɛɛ hi si ngɛ kpoo peemi mi kɛ hyɛ e bami ɔ blɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TH 5:7" />Nyɔ mi ji be nɛ a hwɔɔ mahe kɛ be nɛ nihi dee da. <verse eid="1TH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TH 5:8" />Se nyɛ ha nɛ wɔ nɛ wa ji la bimɛ ɔ, waa hi si ngɛ kpoo peemi kɛ he si bami mi nɛ waa kɛ hemi kɛ yemi kɛ suɔmi nɛ bu wa he, nɛ wa na hɛ nɔ kami kɛ ha wa yi wami hemi.<verse eid="1TH 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TH 5:9" />Ejakaa Mawu tsɛ we wɔ nɛ e na wa he abofu, se mohu nɛ e he wa yi wami kɛ gu wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo nɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TH 5:10" />E gbo ha wɔ konɛ ke wa gbo jio, wa hɛ ngɛ jio, waa kɛ lɛ nɛ hi si daa. <verse eid="1TH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TH 5:11" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, nyɛɛ wo nyɛ bi he wami nɛ nyɛɛ ye kɛ bua nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ wa kaa bɔ nɛ nyɛ ngɛ pee ɔ.<verse eid="1TH 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TH 5:12" />Mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, nyɛɛ bu asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ nɛ ngɛ nyɛ he dengme gboe, nɛ a bɔɔ nyɛ yayami peemi he kɔkɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TH 5:13" />Nyɛɛ bu mɛ saminya, nɛ nyɛɛ suɔ mɛ kɛ nyɛ tsui mi kulaa, ejakaa a ngɛ nyɛ kaie kaa nyɛ ko pɛ.<verse eid="1TH 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TH 5:14" />Mamimɛ nɛ a suɔ, nyɛɛ tu munyu kɛ tsɔɔ hejɔtsɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ nyɛɛ wo nihi nɛ yee gbeye ɔmɛ he wami. Nyɛɛ ye kɛ bua nihi nɛ gbɔjɔ ɔmɛ; nɛ nyɛɛ to nyɛ tsui si kɛ ha nɔ tsuaa nɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TH 5:15" />Nyɛɛ hyɛ nɛ nɔ ko kɛ yayami nɛ kó to yayami nane mi. Se mohu nyɛɛ bɔ mɔde nɛ nyɛɛ pee kpakpa kɛ ha nyɛ he kɛ nɔ tsua nɔ be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="1TH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TH 5:16" />Nyɛ bua nɛ jɔ nyɛ he be fɛɛ be. <verse eid="1TH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TH 5:17" />Nyɛɛ sɔle daa nɛ nyɛ ko jɔɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TH 5:18" />Bɔ fɛɛ bɔ nɛ e ji ha a, nyɛɛ na Mawu si daa ngɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ he, ejakaa e ji Mawu suɔmi nya nɔ́ kaa nyɛ nɛ nyɛ ji Kristo Yesu níhi ɔ nyɛɛ pee ja.<verse eid="1TH 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TH 5:19" />Nyɛ ko wo Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ he mu, <verse eid="1TH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TH 5:20" />nɛ nyɛ ko ye gbali a he fɛu. <verse eid="1TH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TH 5:21" />Se mohu, nyɛɛ ka nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ a de ɔ nɛ nyɛɛ hyɛ ha kaa e ji anɔkuale loko ji nyɛ he nɛ nyɛɛ ye. <verse eid="1TH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TH 5:22" />Nyɛɛ yu nyɛ he kɛ je yayami fɛɛ yayami he. <verse eid="1TH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TH 5:23" />He jɔmi Mawu ɔ nitsɛ nɛ tsukɔ nyɛ he kɛ pi si, nɛ e to nyɛ mumi kɛ nyɛ klaa kɛ nyɛ nɔmlɔ tso kulaa nɛ piami ko nɛ kó hi he kɛ ya si wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo bami be ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TH 5:24" />Mawu, nɔ nɛ tsɛ nyɛ nɛ e pee nyɛ e bimɛ ɔ, maa pee enɛ ɔ tsuo ha nyɛ kaa bɔ nɛ e wo he si ɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TH 5:25" />Nyɛmimɛ nɛ a suɔ, nyɛɛ sɔle kɛ ha wɔ. <verse eid="1TH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1TH 5:26" />Nyɛ nga nyɛmimɛ ɔmɛ tsuo nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ ha mi. <verse eid="1TH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1TH 5:27" />I ngɛ nyɛ fãe ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ biɛ mi kaa nyɛɛ kane womi nɛ ɔ kɛ ha Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ tsuo. <verse eid="1TH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1TH 5:28" />Wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dloomi babauu ɔ kɛ nyɛ ti nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ hi si.<verse eid="1TH 5:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TH 5" />
</usx>